OL,3,GNEWSAWho is mystery figure hidden in   
OL,4,Amartyr's portrait?                     
OL,6,FAnalysis of a 360-year-old painting of 
OL,7,Fa Manx martyr has found a second figure
OL,8,Fhidden beneath the surface.            
OL,10,FThe portrait of William Christian,     
OL,11,Fknown as IIliam Dhone, underwent       
OL,12,Finfrared imaging as part of a major    
OL,13,Fconservation project that began in     
OL,14,F2023.                                  
OL,16,FManx National Heritage (MNH)           
OL,17,Fconservator Christopher Weeks said the 
OL,18,Fsecond figure was dressed in the style 
OL,19,Fof Oliver Cromwell's parliamentary     
OL,20,Fforces and was likely to have been     
OL,21,Fconcealed after the restoration of the 
OL,22,Fmonarchy in 1660.                      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
