OL,3,GNEWSAWho is mystery figure hidden in   
OL,4,Amartyr's portrait?                     
OL,6,FFunding has now been secured for       
OL,7,Ffurther detailed technical analysis,   
OL,8,Fconservation and restoration work by a 
OL,9,Fspecialist firm in Cambridge.          
